  <dc:description>
   <rdf:Alt>
    <rdf:li xml:lang='x-default'>A black silhouette of a man stands confidently with one hand on his hip, wearing a formal suit and tie. The background is plain white, emphasizing the stark outline of the figure.</rdf:li>
